# Regenerable compiler outputs. Retain record.tsv, SDK settings, and logs.
*.air
*.metallib
# `compatibility_probe.sh` stages the kernel into `src-a/` and `src-b/` to
# compile identical bytes from two absolute directories; those two copies are
# run products. This names those directories rather than the bare filename,
# because a retained `producers/` copy of the same kernel is byte evidence a
# replay verifies against the record and must stay tracked.
**/src-a/copy.metal
**/src-b/copy.metal
